<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Barprop lifts yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Barprop lifts yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     19.0	  vs  17.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 15.8	  vs  14.5</p>
<p>    Operating profit	57.20	 vs  58.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   38.70	 vs  66.37</p>
<p>    Tax			  7.70	 vs   9.58</p>
<p>    Turnover		  68.60	 vs  66.35</p>
<p>Div payable November 29</p>
<p>on register November 8</p>
<p>Full name: Barprop Limited (property)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     16.30	 vs  43.38</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
